"""Backend, third content round: topics 531, 711-713 and 535-540 (region f2-backend, orders 27-36).

711-713 replaced 532-534 (event sourcing, multi-tenancy, fan-out tail latency), which duplicated System Design
lessons 503, 508 and 501; 531, 537 and 539 were refocused on implementation detail to avoid overlap with
SD 504, DB 554/555 and Security 575/579.

Run: python3 scripts/authoring/more3/be.py  -> writes scripts/authored/fund-backend-more3.json
Helpers come from ../more2/common.py so the format matches the earlier rounds exactly.
"""
import json, os, sys
